WEBVTT

00:37.538 --> 00:40.457
Ah, shit. I really thought
you'd do better than this.

00:48.173 --> 00:50.049
Why are you giving me this?

00:50.050 --> 00:53.094
Sunok, I think I really like you.

00:53.095 --> 00:54.303
You like me?

00:54.304 --> 00:55.305
Yeah.

00:59.309 --> 01:01.852
Hold on.

01:01.853 --> 01:03.688
Up next...

01:03.689 --> 01:05.731
Pretty sure it's my turn.

01:05.732 --> 01:07.441
And here's the ribbon!

01:07.442 --> 01:08.609
Whoa!

01:08.610 --> 01:10.903
In an effort
to boost areas hit hard by the decline

01:10.904 --> 01:12.196
of the coal industry...

01:12.197 --> 01:13.614
Hey, where's Sunok?

01:13.615 --> 01:15.032
- Mm, not sure.
-  I don't know where she is.

01:15.033 --> 01:16.242
GOLD LAND HOTEL & RESORT CONSTRUCTION SITE

01:16.243 --> 01:17.744
-  Sunok needs to see this.
-  She must be somewhere.

01:32.092 --> 01:33.175
What the...

01:33.176 --> 01:34.468
Shit!

01:34.469 --> 01:35.553
This crazy bastard!

01:35.554 --> 01:36.804
Hold him, hold him!

01:36.805 --> 01:38.390
-  Fuck me.
-  That way.

01:39.516 --> 01:41.100
Come on.

01:41.101 --> 01:43.437
Don't be so rash.
You're still young.

01:44.604 --> 01:47.065
What you should be doing is working
to pay off your debts.

01:48.275 --> 01:50.818
How could I ever pay it all back?

01:50.819 --> 01:52.778
I know, right?

01:52.779 --> 01:54.573
On your police salary?

01:55.407 --> 01:58.200
Well, you should've known your place
before pushing it so far.

01:58.201 --> 01:59.453
I know, I know.

02:00.037 --> 02:03.122
Just kill me,
and only me, okay?

02:03.123 --> 02:05.750
But please leave
that innocent woman alone.

02:05.751 --> 02:07.002
I'm begging you.

02:07.627 --> 02:09.338
You don't need to pay us back.

02:10.172 --> 02:11.465
At least not entirely with money.

02:13.175 --> 02:14.635
Constable Kim Jinman.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.471
What if...

02:20.182 --> 02:22.309
You became my man instead, yeah?

03:20.659 --> 03:23.662
:cue

04:04.077 --> 04:05.828
EPISODE 7
VILLAINS

04:19.968 --> 04:21.720
Why are you here?

04:23.513 --> 04:24.848
H-Heeju.

04:27.476 --> 04:29.436
I told you not to come here, didn't I?

04:30.145 --> 04:32.230
- The gold bars aren't here.
-  Let's not do this.

04:32.814 --> 04:35.941
Let's just take the gold
and leave together.

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
I already made
the deal with the buyers.

04:37.778 --> 04:40.529
All we need to do is go to Cambodia
and show them the gold bars.

04:40.530 --> 04:42.532
We'll have 100 billion won in our account!

04:43.450 --> 04:44.951
I'm already giving you half.

04:45.744 --> 04:47.244
Isn't that enough?

04:47.245 --> 04:49.581
- Do you really have to take it all?
- Heeju.

04:57.297 --> 04:58.757
Heeju, what happened to you?

05:00.175 --> 05:01.802
Why are you doing this?

05:14.523 --> 05:16.024
So this is what it was like.

05:17.484 --> 05:18.860
The place you grew up in.

05:21.112 --> 05:22.780
You said it was hell.

05:22.781 --> 05:24.282
So why are you here again?

05:25.575 --> 05:26.701
What happened to you?

05:30.580 --> 05:32.457
Look, if this is because
of something I've done...

05:34.167 --> 05:36.086
...at least give me a chance
to explain myself.

05:37.170 --> 05:39.548
You can do that, can't you?
After all we've been through?

05:41.341 --> 05:42.342
Dokyung.

05:44.427 --> 05:45.637
Look at us right now.

05:48.223 --> 05:49.391
This is the reason.

05:49.975 --> 05:52.435
This is why we shouldn't
be together any longer.

05:54.187 --> 05:55.688
Nothing happened.

05:55.689 --> 05:57.148
And we're not bad people.

05:58.275 --> 05:59.901
This is just how life is.

06:01.361 --> 06:03.154
When you win something really big.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.908
You have to lose something else.

06:07.868 --> 06:09.369
A thing that's less precious.

06:10.328 --> 06:11.496
And quite frankly...

06:12.664 --> 06:15.291
...I'm the one who has the gold now.
It's mine.

06:15.292 --> 06:17.711
It's up to me whether I share
it with you or not.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.213
Heeju.

06:22.173 --> 06:23.216
Get out.

06:24.718 --> 06:26.303
And don't ever look for me again.

06:28.346 --> 06:29.973
It's true that because of you...

06:31.057 --> 06:33.560
...I finally got out of the hell hole
I'd been living in.

06:35.228 --> 06:36.980
And being with you made me happy.

06:38.315 --> 06:41.526
But we can't be happy together anymore.
That's why it needs to end.

07:12.849 --> 07:15.852
:cue

07:31.076 --> 07:32.242
- Thank you.
- Oh.

07:32.243 --> 07:33.452
Thank you very much.

07:39.125 --> 07:40.209
That's great to hear.

07:42.253 --> 07:44.088
- And so it begins.
- Ah, look who it is!

07:44.089 --> 07:45.923
Sir, you're here.

07:45.924 --> 07:48.425
-  Mr. Ahn.
- Thank you for coming. I know you're busy.

07:48.426 --> 07:49.760
Well, how could I miss it?

07:49.761 --> 07:51.470
It's your business, Mr. Ahn.

07:52.681 --> 07:54.765
Oh, right.
This is our partner from Cambodia.

07:54.766 --> 07:55.849
- Ah.
- Our governor.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.017
- How do you do?
- Nice to meet you.

07:57.018 --> 07:58.102
-  Congratulations.
-  Thank you.

07:58.103 --> 07:59.770
-  Of course.
-  Yes.

07:59.771 --> 08:01.021
- Thank you.
- Thank you very much.

08:01.022 --> 08:02.064
-  Thank you.
-  It's been a pleasure.

08:02.065 --> 08:03.107
Absolutely.

08:03.108 --> 08:04.149
And this
is the congressman.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.859
I've been looking forward
to meeting you.

08:11.908 --> 08:13.868
The actors played their parts well.

08:15.161 --> 08:16.995
Make sure everyone keeps their mouth shut.

08:16.996 --> 08:18.248
No loose lips.

08:19.833 --> 08:21.917
And I want this deal on
the front page tomorrow.

08:21.918 --> 08:23.128
Understood, sir.

08:24.462 --> 08:25.963
Those Cambodians.

08:25.964 --> 08:28.049
Stick 'em in a room and keep 'em happy.

08:28.508 --> 08:30.634
Drugs, drinks, women, whatever it takes.

08:30.635 --> 08:32.052
Don't want 'em getting ideas.

08:32.053 --> 08:33.762
Yes, sir.

08:33.763 --> 08:36.307
Ah, all this bullshit
for one single casket!

08:37.183 --> 08:38.267
Hello, sir.

08:38.268 --> 08:39.269
It's been a while.

08:51.197 --> 08:53.032
Where's the casket?

08:53.033 --> 08:54.034
Who took it?

08:55.285 --> 08:57.829
Yeah, well, it's, uh...

08:59.456 --> 09:00.457
It was this woman, right?

09:02.333 --> 09:03.667
- Yeah.
-  It was?

09:03.668 --> 09:05.962
-  Yeah.
- Look, different name.

09:06.588 --> 09:08.965
So it wasn't Cha Yujin.
It was Kim Heeju.

09:11.634 --> 09:13.511
The thing is, sir,
it's just...

09:14.262 --> 09:16.722
...we're talkin' about one ton
of gold bars, here.

09:16.723 --> 09:18.475
And having to smuggle and sell it?

09:19.309 --> 09:21.394
I don't think anyone could do
that by themselves.

09:22.353 --> 09:23.520
They must have had help.

09:23.521 --> 09:25.190
Someone else is pulling the strings?

09:26.816 --> 09:28.025
Suspect anyone?

09:28.026 --> 09:29.277
We'll find out
once we investigate.

09:30.653 --> 09:35.616
Although, with the police being involved,
it can get pretty risky.

09:35.617 --> 09:36.784
Do you want cash?

09:36.785 --> 09:37.786
Well, I...

09:39.037 --> 09:41.831
...I do always need more money, sir.

09:42.457 --> 09:43.875
How much you want?

09:44.793 --> 09:46.794
One gold bar.
That's it.

09:46.795 --> 09:47.796
That's all I want.

09:49.047 --> 09:50.423
Give me a week to work on this.

09:51.674 --> 09:53.510
I'll find all 100 gold bars.

09:54.803 --> 09:56.386
Keep one for myself.

09:56.387 --> 10:00.517
And then I'll return
the other 99 back to you, sir.

10:01.017 --> 10:02.976
What do you plan to do with one gold bar?

10:02.977 --> 10:06.481
Well, uh, you know,
I'm getting old now.

10:07.774 --> 10:09.775
I'm thinking of quitting the force.

10:09.776 --> 10:11.693
I wanna buy a pawnshop.

10:11.694 --> 10:14.155
Sit back and take it easy.
Play loan shark.

10:14.656 --> 10:16.365
Just live like that.

10:16.366 --> 10:19.911
I think I've done more than enough, sir.
That's a good end for me.

10:22.455 --> 10:25.125
Sure.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.086
Bring the casket back,
and I'll give you one.

10:30.630 --> 10:31.881
Thank you, sir.

10:34.050 --> 10:35.717
If you need to get in touch,

10:35.718 --> 10:37.303
- go through Chief Cheon.
- Yes.

10:39.264 --> 10:41.975
Well, then, we have an agreement.
Excuse me.

10:44.352 --> 10:45.687
-  Hey, Kim Jinman.
- Yes, sir.

10:47.230 --> 10:50.567
You knew about the gold all along
and you didn't lose your cool.
:cue

10:51.651 --> 10:52.902
You were first, right?

10:53.194 --> 10:54.279
To find out about it?

10:54.821 --> 10:56.739
You're the one who told Hocheol.

10:57.615 --> 10:58.658
But you never thought...

10:59.993 --> 11:02.536
"Should I just keep all the gold
and run away?"

11:02.537 --> 11:04.371
You never felt the urge
to do anything like that?

11:06.708 --> 11:09.668
No, how could I?
I wouldn't touch your property, sir.

11:13.173 --> 11:14.174
Right.

11:15.216 --> 11:17.135
You've always played it small,
haven't you?

11:18.761 --> 11:20.762
I once told him I'd take
his wife's kidney.

11:20.763 --> 11:23.557
He tried to hang himself.

11:23.558 --> 11:25.435
That's how freaked out he was.

11:26.144 --> 11:28.478
So I said I'd spare her life.

11:28.479 --> 11:32.483
And this man starts grovelling, begging.
"I'll do anything you say!"

11:33.651 --> 11:35.235
Just crying.

11:37.405 --> 11:41.033
And that-that's why I like you,
Kim Jinman!

11:41.034 --> 11:42.576
You're still useful!

11:48.333 --> 11:51.210
Four five two one. No.

11:51.211 --> 11:53.170
How about this one here?

11:53.171 --> 11:55.214
JANGGAK TRADE INC.

11:55.215 --> 11:56.549
That's not it, either.

11:57.342 --> 11:59.593
Four three two oh.
Four three two oh.

12:05.058 --> 12:07.477
Ah, shit.
What is it now?

12:10.438 --> 12:11.688
Yeah, what is it?

12:11.689 --> 12:14.691
Are you looking for
a five two seven nine Santa Fe?

12:14.692 --> 12:15.693
Yes.

12:16.402 --> 12:18.570
I'm here, fucker. Here.

12:18.571 --> 12:19.989
Shit.

12:24.994 --> 12:27.747
Hey. I checked all
the cars here earlier today.

12:28.414 --> 12:29.415
It's not here.

12:31.167 --> 12:33.293
So then Park made you do this?

12:33.294 --> 12:35.420
No, Chairman Ahn.

12:36.631 --> 12:38.299
Fuck, this is driving me crazy.

12:41.135 --> 12:42.679
Hey, what's with that car, anyways?

12:43.263 --> 12:44.264
Is it Cha Yujin's?

12:44.764 --> 12:46.015
Well, I don't know.

12:49.310 --> 12:50.311
Hey.

12:51.562 --> 12:52.646
Thought you said you were done.

12:52.647 --> 12:55.233
You weren't gonna work for Geumsong,
so why are you?

12:55.900 --> 12:57.110
We lost Lee Dokyung.

12:59.737 --> 13:00.821
Gosh.

13:00.822 --> 13:02.865
The department's already giving me hell
for this.

13:03.241 --> 13:04.450
Now the director, too.

13:08.997 --> 13:10.832
Just call it a night for now, yeah?

13:11.874 --> 13:15.294
My best guess is that there's a good
chance they got rid of it already.

13:15.295 --> 13:17.297
Probably dumped it in
a reservoir or something.

13:18.756 --> 13:22.093
Just tell Park that the car belonged
to Janggak Trading.

13:23.261 --> 13:25.178
Right.
Yeah, that's a good call.

13:25.179 --> 13:26.180
Yeah.

13:37.608 --> 13:38.609
You find it yet?

13:39.319 --> 13:41.237
Uh, no.
No, not exactly.

13:46.617 --> 13:48.286
You're a stupid fuck.
You know that?

13:52.415 --> 13:55.667
Now wait. You see,
it's not a private vehicle.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.128
It belongs to a company.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.172
Fuck, which one?

13:59.630 --> 14:00.882
It's called Janggak Trading.

14:01.591 --> 14:03.508
It looks like a trading company,

14:03.509 --> 14:05.553
but they buy cheap Chinese cars
and sell them overseas.

14:06.304 --> 14:07.472
Heo Donggu's company?

14:08.264 --> 14:09.891
Yeah.
Do you know it?

14:11.893 --> 14:12.935
Good work.

14:13.936 --> 14:14.937
:cue

14:20.735 --> 14:22.194
It's because my dad
suddenly collapsed.

14:22.195 --> 14:23.196
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

14:23.696 --> 14:26.574
I need to leave so I can help
him out on his farm.

14:27.116 --> 14:28.325
You're an orphan.

14:28.326 --> 14:29.535
Uh...

14:31.204 --> 14:33.038
...he's actually my uncle, not my dad.

14:33.039 --> 14:36.374
Do you think we're a real company
'cause we pay you a salary?

14:36.375 --> 14:38.503
You've always been able
to walk in as you please.

14:39.170 --> 14:41.464
I'll cut off your ear
if you wanna walk out, though.

14:42.882 --> 14:45.176
- Yes, I understand.
- You understand?

14:46.177 --> 14:47.594
Seriously?

14:47.595 --> 14:49.930
Just think it over.

14:49.931 --> 14:52.140
You won't make this kind
of money anywhere else.

14:52.141 --> 14:54.018
And you're one of our best.

14:56.604 --> 14:58.730
Now get out.
Go on.

14:58.731 --> 15:01.400
Back to work, now!
Go, go, go, go.

15:05.154 --> 15:06.155
Hey.

15:11.119 --> 15:12.120
Sir.

15:15.414 --> 15:16.832
It was you.

15:20.920 --> 15:21.921
No, it wasn't!

15:24.132 --> 15:25.341
What do you mean?

15:27.468 --> 15:30.054
You're that kid whose ear
I almost took off, right?

15:31.806 --> 15:34.183
Uh, yes. That's correct.

15:35.852 --> 15:37.018
It's still on there.

15:37.019 --> 15:39.522
Yes. It healed up well.

15:44.152 --> 15:45.278
Go on.

15:54.537 --> 15:55.580
Boss.

15:56.205 --> 15:57.581
Have a seat over here.

15:57.582 --> 15:59.249
Or should I call you President?

15:59.250 --> 16:01.126
You think I dragged myself here...

16:02.295 --> 16:04.087
...just so I can sit in that chair again?

16:04.088 --> 16:07.425
That's true.

16:09.468 --> 16:11.012
Gitae, let's find the casket.

16:11.554 --> 16:13.055
Do you even know where it is?

16:14.932 --> 16:16.725
Well, come on, then!

16:16.726 --> 16:18.268
Let's go get it!

16:18.269 --> 16:20.938
And then, boom, your honor is back!

16:21.564 --> 16:22.690
We have to!

16:30.323 --> 16:31.865
It's Detective Kim.

16:31.866 --> 16:33.993
He thinks Janggak Trading is behind this.

16:34.785 --> 16:36.411
Janggak Trading?

16:36.412 --> 16:39.332
He told me you'd recognize
what that refers to.

16:46.589 --> 16:47.715
What's Janggak Trading?

16:48.466 --> 16:52.344
Oh, hello, sir.
Uh, it's Heo Donggu's company. Yeah.

16:52.345 --> 16:55.223
He was the man you kicked out, uh,
about ten years ago.

16:55.514 --> 16:57.807
-  Oh.
- You remember, right?

16:57.808 --> 16:59.644
Okay, stay there.
Keep an eye on him.

17:06.067 --> 17:08.903
Grab a few guys.
Head to Janggak Trading.

17:09.111 --> 17:10.195
When you get there,

17:10.196 --> 17:13.532
cut off Heo Donggu's other ear
and find the casket. Get moving.

17:14.200 --> 17:15.742
Yes, sir.

17:15.743 --> 17:17.869
Ah, let's go.

17:17.870 --> 17:19.163
Janggak Trading?

17:19.872 --> 17:20.873
Mm-hmm.

17:22.124 --> 17:23.792
You know what those guys do, right?

17:23.793 --> 17:25.210
And you're buying a ferry ticket there?

17:25.211 --> 17:26.504
I know.

17:27.255 --> 17:28.422
I got the car there.

17:30.883 --> 17:32.552
And that's where I got the bullets, too.

17:33.427 --> 17:36.305
Ah, just give half the gold bars
to Dokyung and let him figure it out!

17:36.973 --> 17:39.600
That bastard is an expert at smuggling!
He'll know what to do!

17:43.229 --> 17:46.190
Heeju, seriously.
What are you thinking? Huh?

17:47.024 --> 17:48.025
We're not doing this.

17:48.568 --> 17:49.569
'Kay?

17:50.361 --> 17:53.656
You're giving him half the gold.
Buying a ferry ticket.

17:54.073 --> 17:55.658
You can't think like that anymore.

17:56.742 --> 17:58.578
We have to start looking out
for ourselves first.

18:07.044 --> 18:08.212
:cue

18:14.302 --> 18:19.599
JG JANGGAK TRADE INC.
TRADING/ TRANSPORT/ LOGISTICS

18:29.525 --> 18:30.526
Heeju.

18:37.074 --> 18:38.242
The gold bars.

18:39.327 --> 18:40.536
Why don't you just tell me where they are?

18:41.829 --> 18:43.371
It'd be just in case.

18:43.372 --> 18:46.583
If anything bad were to happen to you,
then don't you think I should know?

18:46.584 --> 18:47.959
Woogy.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.961
Why don't we do this?

18:49.754 --> 18:51.254
You could schedule an E-mail.

18:51.255 --> 18:53.423
Write it in there,
set it to send later.

18:53.424 --> 18:55.718
And if you come back safely,
you could just delete it.

18:57.178 --> 18:59.180
So then if I were to come back safely...

19:00.097 --> 19:01.474
...you would just kill me, right?

19:03.309 --> 19:05.061
Right, I see why you'd think that.

19:06.854 --> 19:08.480
Heeju, just be careful.

19:08.481 --> 19:10.106
- I really mean it, okay?
- Okay.

19:10.107 --> 19:12.568
Seriously, those guys can be crazy.
You need to watch your back.

19:27.333 --> 19:28.334
Kim Heeju?

19:35.216 --> 19:36.258
What is this?

19:38.010 --> 19:39.011
Anywhere?

19:41.055 --> 19:42.056
I see.

19:44.350 --> 19:48.103
There's a ferry leaving Mokcheon Port
in two days, if that works for you.

19:48.104 --> 19:49.729
What are you loading?

19:49.730 --> 19:51.232
There's one car.

19:52.149 --> 19:53.441
And one passenger.

19:53.442 --> 19:54.735
Stow away?

19:58.447 --> 20:00.449
That's not a cheap thing to do, you know.

20:01.492 --> 20:04.869
Ten million, even 20 million won
just won't cut it.

20:04.870 --> 20:07.248
These days,
pocket change isn't enough.

20:12.002 --> 20:13.712
Take this up front.

20:13.713 --> 20:16.799
Once the transport is done,
I'll give you another one.

20:29.562 --> 20:32.898
All right, Park, you asshole.
Just show up already.

20:42.158 --> 20:43.408
Hey, yeah, Chief Cheon.

20:43.409 --> 20:45.077
Park is here right now.
You coming or what?

20:47.079 --> 20:48.873
Is that Park?

20:52.877 --> 20:54.919
HEEJU, DIRECTOR PARK IS HERE.

20:59.925 --> 21:01.343
GET OUT OF THERE RIGHT NOW.

21:02.428 --> 21:03.471
What?

21:07.558 --> 21:11.561
Wait. Did you mess around
with Geumseong's stuff?

21:11.562 --> 21:16.024
You did! Come here! Come over here!
Quickly! Go, go, go, go, go!

21:16.025 --> 21:17.610
Hide here!

21:18.694 --> 21:21.780
In here! Okay. Inside this!
You need to get in. Okay.

21:21.781 --> 21:25.492
They won't find you in here. Here!
Don't even breathe! Okay?

21:25.493 --> 21:28.328
Don't make any noise!
You need to stay hidden in here!

21:28.329 --> 21:30.663
Okay, good. Good.

21:33.834 --> 21:35.878
Oh, fuck me!

21:36.962 --> 21:38.797
Oh, gosh, I don't know!

21:38.798 --> 21:39.965
Ah!

21:41.175 --> 21:43.593
Hey there, Donggu.
It's been a while.

21:46.847 --> 21:50.226
Hey, I think there was a misunderstanding, right?

21:51.227 --> 21:52.227
What?

21:57.733 --> 21:59.400
You know I don't say things I don't mean.

21:59.401 --> 22:01.529
Where'd you hide the casket?

22:02.071 --> 22:04.113
Tell me or I'll take your other ear.

22:04.114 --> 22:05.573
This is all a misunderstanding!

22:05.574 --> 22:08.701
This isn't a funeral home!
Why would you look for a casket here?

22:08.702 --> 22:10.287
Wait!

22:16.043 --> 22:17.086
Stop it!

22:17.545 --> 22:20.256
:cue

22:26.554 --> 22:28.555
What the actual fuck?

22:28.556 --> 22:29.557
Get up there!

22:39.233 --> 22:42.944
Ju! Ju Haran! Ah!
It's Ju Haran!

22:42.945 --> 22:44.404
It's Ju Haran!

22:44.405 --> 22:46.155
Who is Ju Haran?

22:51.996 --> 22:53.204
Oh, shit!

22:53.205 --> 22:55.331
Hey, boss!

22:55.332 --> 22:56.749
-  Hurry!
- Fuck's sake!

22:56.750 --> 22:57.876
Ju Haran!
Who the fuck is she?

22:57.877 --> 22:59.210
I'm answering you!

23:05.342 --> 23:06.718
Fuck, it reeks in here.

23:08.554 --> 23:09.721
What's this?

23:09.722 --> 23:12.307
This a Geumsong Alumni reunion?

23:15.352 --> 23:16.896
Ah, come on.

23:17.521 --> 23:19.231
I'm really disappointed in you, Park.

23:20.024 --> 23:21.442
The chairman gave you a chance.

23:22.234 --> 23:23.319
But you know what you are?

23:24.403 --> 23:25.779
You're too old school.

23:26.322 --> 23:27.656
It's fucking pathetic.

23:28.908 --> 23:30.658
Both of you are.

23:30.659 --> 23:31.910
You thought you could take
the chairman's casket

23:31.911 --> 23:33.286
and just get away with it?

23:33.287 --> 23:34.997
It was a rhetorical question, you fuck.

23:35.581 --> 23:37.708
'Kay, last chance.

23:38.417 --> 23:40.293
Who'd like to be the first to talk?

23:40.294 --> 23:42.170
Where's the casket?

23:42.171 --> 23:43.796
Okay, listen. It's not like that.

23:43.797 --> 23:46.007
The boss and I came here for Donggu.

23:46.008 --> 23:47.717
- He's the one who stole the casket.
-  Bullshit!

23:47.718 --> 23:49.845
- He took it.
- I don't fucking have it, you liar!

23:50.596 --> 23:52.931
Just, fuck.

23:52.932 --> 23:54.724
Just give me a second to explain!

23:54.725 --> 23:56.100
That car?

23:56.101 --> 23:59.312
A week ago a lady called Ju Haran came by
and bought it from me.

23:59.313 --> 24:01.147
- Ju Haran, huh?
-  Fuck, how many times

24:01.148 --> 24:03.399
do I have to tell you?
How do I explain this?

24:03.400 --> 24:05.652
I have no idea, really!
I don't know!

24:05.653 --> 24:07.403
I've never once seen the casket!

24:07.404 --> 24:09.781
All I did was to sell a car
to this woman named Ju Haran.

24:09.782 --> 24:12.534
You don't believe me?
Let me show you the contract she signed!

24:13.243 --> 24:14.244
Where is it?

24:15.454 --> 24:16.622
I'll get it!

24:24.838 --> 24:26.882
It's here!
This one!

24:31.845 --> 24:33.389
What are you doing?

24:36.517 --> 24:37.642
Boss.

24:37.643 --> 24:39.435
Hand it over!

24:39.436 --> 24:41.438
They think we're the ones
who stole the casket!

24:43.524 --> 24:44.942
I'd like to see it now.

24:50.990 --> 24:53.324
Come and get it, you motherfucker.

24:53.325 --> 24:56.745
Wow. You're fucking stubborn.

24:58.122 --> 24:59.415
Keep him alive, okay?

25:01.125 --> 25:02.751
Wait!

26:01.685 --> 26:02.978
You fucking asshole!

26:09.151 --> 26:10.818
Oh, fuck.

26:32.299 --> 26:33.634
Wait, wait, wait!

26:34.384 --> 26:38.012
Okay, okay! You win, Park!
You win, Park! You win, Park, okay?

26:38.013 --> 26:40.139
Just a sec.
Let's not do this.
:cue

26:40.140 --> 26:41.974
We'll let you go if you just apologize.

26:41.975 --> 26:43.601
We can just bring
any old document and-

26:43.602 --> 26:46.854
Shit, okay, never mind! I'm sorry, okay?

26:46.855 --> 26:48.523
Let's just find the casket!

26:48.524 --> 26:50.818
Then the Chairman'll spare your life,
right? Okay?

26:51.360 --> 26:53.027
I can explain everything.

26:54.863 --> 26:55.988
Boss!

26:55.989 --> 26:57.490
Have you lost your mind?

26:59.326 --> 27:01.662
Shit. Fuck!

27:08.043 --> 27:10.169
You wanna save him,
you better take him to the hospital.

27:15.425 --> 27:16.801
Boss!

27:16.802 --> 27:18.220
Oh, man.

27:20.806 --> 27:22.807
What the-
is Park running away?

27:22.808 --> 27:25.185
Shit. Shit.

27:25.727 --> 27:27.103
This fucking...

27:41.785 --> 27:43.120
Oh, sh-

27:51.753 --> 27:54.338
What the fuck is even going on?

27:54.339 --> 27:57.383
Hey, what happened here?
Heo Donggu, what just happened?

27:57.384 --> 27:58.634
Oh, fuck!

27:58.635 --> 28:01.095
What do you think happened?
Just take a look around!

28:01.096 --> 28:03.306
Ju Haran, I'm looking for her.
Have you seen her?

28:03.307 --> 28:06.142
Ju Haran? Well, I dunno.
Look at this place. I dunno.

28:06.143 --> 28:08.769
I saw her walk in here with my own eyes,
you asshole!

28:08.770 --> 28:10.730
What are you talking about?
Nobody came here!

28:10.731 --> 28:12.231
Can't you see this mess?

28:12.232 --> 28:14.400
You motherfucker! If you're lying to me,
I swear I'll fucking kill you.

28:14.401 --> 28:16.903
I'm not lying! Why would I?
I'm not lying to you! I swear!

28:16.904 --> 28:17.987
Detective Kim!

28:17.988 --> 28:19.281
Over here!

28:19.823 --> 28:21.157
Help me out!

28:21.158 --> 28:22.825
-  Please, hurry!
- This fucking...

28:22.826 --> 28:24.994
Detective Kim!
Come on, hurry up!

28:24.995 --> 28:27.580
- Get over here! Come on, hurry!
- What happened to Chief Cheon?

28:27.581 --> 28:28.873
Come on, get over here!

28:30.959 --> 28:32.210
Here we go.

28:33.045 --> 28:35.046
Get him out of here.

28:35.047 --> 28:36.297
- Stay with us, Chief Cheon!
- Shit.

28:36.298 --> 28:39.425
If you die, we'll all end up dead!
Come on, we gotta move!

28:42.930 --> 28:44.890
Come on!

28:45.766 --> 28:47.224
Shit.

28:47.225 --> 28:48.810
Oh!

28:49.227 --> 28:50.270
Hello? Heeju?

28:50.812 --> 28:52.480
Tell me what the fuck
is goin' on in there!

28:52.481 --> 28:54.315
Woogy, you have to run.

28:54.316 --> 28:56.234
Detective Kim is heading your way.

28:56.944 --> 28:58.277
What are you gonna-

28:58.278 --> 28:59.279
Hello?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.364
Shit.

29:01.365 --> 29:04.076
Chief Cheon!
Please, please, don't die!

29:04.743 --> 29:06.869
Please don't die!

29:06.870 --> 29:08.580
We're in big trouble.

29:11.667 --> 29:13.001
No!

29:13.794 --> 29:15.002
They're all gone.

29:18.924 --> 29:20.509
You can come out now.

29:32.187 --> 29:33.188
Listen.

29:33.772 --> 29:34.940
Let's make a deal.

29:36.566 --> 29:38.901
Those men,
the ones that were here,

29:38.902 --> 29:40.278
I'm not like them at all.

29:41.113 --> 29:42.781
And I'm not that greedy, either.

29:43.699 --> 29:46.283
I'm not ambitious.

29:46.284 --> 29:48.662
All I'd like is to live a long life.

29:49.413 --> 29:53.541
And drugs, I'm out of that business.
I cut all connections ten years ago!

29:53.542 --> 29:54.918
I'm my own man now.

29:55.752 --> 29:57.004
The casket...

29:58.255 --> 30:01.216
Listen, shit, I really don't care
about it at all.

30:02.134 --> 30:04.510
Why else would I hide you in that cabinet?

30:04.511 --> 30:08.055
I hid you and I didn't tell those guys
that you're actually Kim Heeju,

30:08.056 --> 30:09.307
not Ju Haran.

30:11.810 --> 30:13.228
So what do you want from me?

30:15.731 --> 30:17.065
The transport fee.

30:18.275 --> 30:19.568
Ten gold bars.

30:20.235 --> 30:21.361
One billion won?

30:23.321 --> 30:25.072
We can negotiate, too.

30:25.073 --> 30:27.992
And also, uh,
after sales service?

30:27.993 --> 30:30.453
I'll take full responsibility
for everything right up till the end!

30:30.454 --> 30:31.455
I swear it!

30:33.206 --> 30:34.374
I mean it.

30:36.626 --> 30:39.337
Look, that car over there.

30:39.838 --> 30:42.841
It's collateral I got yesterday.
You can take it. It's on me.

30:43.759 --> 30:45.342
I haven't even taken it to the garage yet.

30:45.343 --> 30:48.929
Feel free to drive it as much as you want,
and then get rid of it.

30:48.930 --> 30:51.725
:cue

31:02.652 --> 31:04.196
You can rest now.

31:09.993 --> 31:12.661
No need to make a big deal out of it.
Just have him cremated.

31:12.662 --> 31:13.663
Yes, sir.

31:14.206 --> 31:16.666
- Let Kim Jinman take care of the rest.
- Yes, sir.

31:17.084 --> 31:18.585
Have you found Park Hocheol yet?

31:19.544 --> 31:20.753
No.

31:20.754 --> 31:21.755
What?

31:23.173 --> 31:26.175
Get out there and find him immediately
before I rip each and every one of you

31:26.176 --> 31:27.511
- into fucking pieces!
- Right away.

31:36.311 --> 31:37.938
Are you doing okay, Ko?

31:38.605 --> 31:39.773
Yes, I'm okay, sir.

31:41.316 --> 31:43.568
Did you really not know
that Park had a lead?

31:44.486 --> 31:46.071
On the casket?

31:46.571 --> 31:50.407
Well, I hadn't really considered
that he would still be after it, sir.

31:50.408 --> 31:54.703
Honestly, uh,
I thought he'd gone back to Yes Money

31:54.704 --> 31:56.705
- and just given up on it.
- Whatever.

31:56.706 --> 31:59.250
Now bring me either Lee Dokyung
or Ju Haran.

31:59.251 --> 32:02.711
You're supposed to be the expert on this.
Just do your job.

32:02.712 --> 32:04.548
Then I'll get 'em to talk.

32:05.340 --> 32:06.967
Let's stick to what we're good at.

32:07.759 --> 32:08.760
Yes, sir.

32:09.344 --> 32:13.181
But if Park Hocheol finds that girl
or the casket before you do...

32:14.307 --> 32:16.725
...you can kiss one of your ears goodbye.

32:24.693 --> 32:27.696
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

33:47.984 --> 33:51.112
INCOMING CALL
SUNOK

33:56.243 --> 33:57.244
Hello?

33:58.453 --> 33:59.871
Can I see you for a bit?

34:03.083 --> 34:04.084
Now?

34:06.044 --> 34:07.254
Uh...

34:08.713 --> 34:09.798
Okay.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.841
Be right there.
:cue

34:17.847 --> 34:19.974
Ah, dammit.

34:46.167 --> 34:50.879
VEHICLE TRANSFER CERTIFICATE
JU HARAN

34:50.880 --> 34:52.089
Ju Haran.

34:52.090 --> 34:54.551
I've heard that name before.
Fuck.

34:56.428 --> 34:57.637
Dammit.

35:02.892 --> 35:04.686
That's the bitch I killed.

35:12.527 --> 35:19.534
YES MONEY

35:36.051 --> 35:38.469
Boss.

35:38.470 --> 35:40.095
- Boss.
-  What?

35:40.096 --> 35:42.097
Did you see a ghost or something?

35:46.895 --> 35:47.979
Sir, what're...

35:50.398 --> 35:52.317
Nobody saw anything,
so keep your mouth shut.

35:53.568 --> 35:55.235
And no makin' any phone calls!

35:55.236 --> 35:56.779
-  Yes, sir.
-  Now get the fuck out.

35:56.780 --> 35:57.864
Shut the door.

35:58.865 --> 36:00.575
Why'd you come here?

36:03.370 --> 36:04.662
You know you're being hunted.

36:04.663 --> 36:07.081
The Geumseong guys
are all over looking for you.

36:08.833 --> 36:10.168
Where else should I go?

36:11.211 --> 36:12.504
This here is my turf.

36:13.380 --> 36:14.923
You know Chief Cheon died, right?

36:15.382 --> 36:16.466
He was cremated.

36:17.175 --> 36:19.010
- Yeah?
- Leave Jeongsan.

36:19.761 --> 36:21.804
Chairman Ahn will find out you were here.

36:21.805 --> 36:23.348
And then he'll murder us both.

36:25.642 --> 36:26.893
Where's Ju Haran?

36:29.479 --> 36:30.480
I don't know.

36:32.232 --> 36:34.025
The Geumseong guys must be looking
for her.

36:35.402 --> 36:36.403
Gitae.

36:38.738 --> 36:40.532
Do you know who Ju Haran is?

36:41.950 --> 36:42.992
No, who?

36:43.493 --> 36:44.828
You know Gu Jaok, right?

36:45.662 --> 36:47.789
She's the largest backer in Gangwon.

36:49.082 --> 36:52.711
There's no one in Jeongsan who hasn't
set foot on land that old lady owns.

36:53.545 --> 36:55.713
Ju Haran is her granddaughter.

36:55.714 --> 36:56.715
What?

36:57.549 --> 36:58.717
Around a year ago...

36:59.676 --> 37:03.596
...Chairman Ahn wanted to buy the 2%
of Gu's stake in Gold Land.

37:05.432 --> 37:08.393
That would have made him Gold Land's
biggest shareholder.

37:08.893 --> 37:10.854
However, Ms. Gu knew what he was doing...

37:12.272 --> 37:14.315
...and she refused to hand over her stake.

37:15.066 --> 37:17.569
So I found her collateral,
and took it from her.

37:19.154 --> 37:20.155
Ju Haran.

37:20.989 --> 37:22.615
So what's going on?

37:23.116 --> 37:27.787
If Ju is her granddaughter,
she took the casket...

37:28.913 --> 37:31.165
...is Ms. Gu the one behind all this?

37:31.166 --> 37:33.126
No, that's not it.

37:35.378 --> 37:36.838
Ju Haran's already dead.
:cue

37:37.839 --> 37:39.007
I killed her.

37:40.008 --> 37:42.802
Mr. Jin took care of the body
and dumped it at the farm.

37:43.470 --> 37:46.555
Well then, who's the Ju Haran
with the casket now?

37:46.556 --> 37:48.265
She's a fake.

37:48.266 --> 37:50.100
Someone's pretending
to be Ju Haran,

37:50.101 --> 37:51.770
and they've even been using her ID.

37:53.021 --> 37:54.481
But as you probably know...

37:55.774 --> 37:57.984
...we're supposed to keep hold
of every ID card.

38:01.154 --> 38:03.907
That's right. ID card.

38:06.868 --> 38:07.951
Let's see.

38:07.952 --> 38:09.411
Fuck.

38:09.412 --> 38:10.747
Where is it?

38:22.967 --> 38:23.968
What's this?

38:27.096 --> 38:28.973
Her ID card is missing.

38:32.811 --> 38:34.896
I didn't do it!

38:35.772 --> 38:36.981
Then who was it?

38:37.816 --> 38:39.025
Who has access to them?

38:42.779 --> 38:44.112
Someone with access.

38:44.113 --> 38:45.365
Who's here alone.

38:46.157 --> 38:47.158
Woogy.

38:47.992 --> 38:50.452
That fucking punk that handles
the office supplies and the cleaning,

38:50.453 --> 38:51.829
all that stuff.

38:51.830 --> 38:53.580
Where's that bastard now?

38:53.581 --> 38:55.583
He tried to leave the company recently.

38:56.459 --> 38:57.627
That piece of shit.

38:59.087 --> 39:00.129
Hey, Moonsu!

39:01.005 --> 39:02.924
- Yes, Boss?
-  You work with Woogy, right?

39:03.174 --> 39:04.258
Yes.

39:04.259 --> 39:06.844
Go find him!
Find him and bring him here!

39:06.845 --> 39:08.221
But Woogy already quit.

39:08.721 --> 39:10.097
Yeah, no shit, you dumb ass!

39:10.098 --> 39:11.975
So fucking bring him to me right now!

39:12.308 --> 39:13.392
Yes, right away.

39:18.356 --> 39:21.149
So, what are you gonna do now, Boss?

39:21.150 --> 39:22.484
What about you?

39:22.485 --> 39:23.903
What are you gonna do?

39:25.238 --> 39:27.155
I'm already tracking down
the fake Ju Haran

39:27.156 --> 39:28.491
and I'm close to finding her.

39:30.201 --> 39:33.328
You can go get that thief
who stole her ID card from us.

39:33.329 --> 39:35.248
After that, we find the casket.

39:35.707 --> 39:36.708
So then...

39:37.292 --> 39:41.129
Wait a sec. Find the casket.
I know that's what you want.

39:42.005 --> 39:44.299
But we'll need to double cross Geumseong
for it.

39:45.133 --> 39:46.885
Do you really think that's worth it?

39:49.137 --> 39:51.013
You don't even know what's inside of it,
do you?

39:51.014 --> 39:52.806
Obviously drugs!

39:52.807 --> 39:54.809
They're a pain in the ass to sell,
ya know?

39:55.310 --> 39:56.936
Gold bars.

39:58.521 --> 39:59.731
One ton.

40:01.316 --> 40:03.526
It's worth 150 billion won.

40:09.115 --> 40:11.492
Now do you get why I turned against Ahn?

40:16.080 --> 40:17.081
But...

40:19.000 --> 40:22.503
...if it's that kind of money,
Chairman Ahn's not just gonna give up.

40:23.379 --> 40:26.882
If he loses that casket,
he'll end up in one of his own.

40:26.883 --> 40:28.926
That's the investment money
from Cambodia

40:28.927 --> 40:30.720
for the joint Gold Resort development.

40:31.471 --> 40:35.058
If the deal falls through
and they don't get their principal back...

40:37.226 --> 40:38.853
...they're not just gonna
let him walk away.

40:40.605 --> 40:42.231
Now, you need to decide.

40:45.401 --> 40:46.945
Whose side are you on?

40:50.031 --> 40:51.491
'Cause I'm all in.

40:55.954 --> 40:58.289
:cue

41:20.186 --> 41:21.353
You're here.

41:21.354 --> 41:22.480
Yeah.

41:26.484 --> 41:28.111
That a side effect of the chemo?

41:29.487 --> 41:31.530
Well, at least
you're getting treatment.

41:31.531 --> 41:32.699
You'll be good soon.

41:35.535 --> 41:36.911
Tomorrow's my surgery.

41:37.870 --> 41:39.706
Really? That's good to hear.

41:40.623 --> 41:41.791
I hope it goes well.

41:43.126 --> 41:44.377
Better sooner than later.

41:48.172 --> 41:49.506
Will your niece be here?

41:49.507 --> 41:50.508
No.

41:54.345 --> 41:56.347
I called because I wanted
to see your face.

41:58.516 --> 42:00.601
Might be the last time I see you.

42:01.227 --> 42:03.896
What are you talking about?
Come on.

42:04.897 --> 42:05.898
Don't know.

42:08.651 --> 42:10.111
I just have a feeling it might.

42:10.820 --> 42:12.280
You're talking nonsense now.

42:12.905 --> 42:14.072
Jeez.

42:16.451 --> 42:17.659
Could...

42:18.995 --> 42:21.414
Could you give me a bath tonight?

42:22.206 --> 42:23.374
A bath?

42:24.250 --> 42:25.251
Mm-hmm.

42:27.170 --> 42:28.379
You remember...

42:30.590 --> 42:32.842
...when we were young
and I'd come home drunk...

42:33.468 --> 42:34.968
...you would help wash me up?

42:38.389 --> 42:39.766
I did?

42:40.725 --> 42:41.976
If I'm going to die...

42:44.353 --> 42:46.355
...I wanna die with some grace.

42:55.031 --> 42:56.115
Looking back...

42:57.867 --> 43:00.119
...that really was the spring time
of my life.

43:03.331 --> 43:04.582
Living in Namju.

43:07.585 --> 43:08.794
With you.

43:08.795 --> 43:10.922
The two of us in that little mining town.

43:14.592 --> 43:15.593
Yeah.

43:16.928 --> 43:18.638
I barely remember those days.

43:23.768 --> 43:25.603
I resented you afterward.

43:26.813 --> 43:27.897
For quite a while.

43:31.692 --> 43:34.487
I always wished that you
hadn't disappeared so suddenly.

43:37.115 --> 43:38.449
Even if I stayed...

43:43.663 --> 43:45.205
Fucking hell.

43:45.206 --> 43:46.581
What kind of a man were you with?

43:46.582 --> 43:47.583
Fuck.

43:49.627 --> 43:52.755
That's what happens when you're nothing
but bad luck.

43:54.799 --> 43:55.883
But back then...

43:56.801 --> 43:58.803
...it really was all I could do
to survive.

44:01.514 --> 44:03.599
The years I spent living with that man...

44:06.144 --> 44:07.603
...they were nothing but hell.

44:10.898 --> 44:13.484
It felt like it wouldn't end until one
of us died.

44:14.986 --> 44:16.028
But...

44:17.613 --> 44:19.323
...the thought of being
the first to die...

44:23.286 --> 44:24.579
...that seemed too unfair.

44:27.832 --> 44:28.833
So then...

44:29.625 --> 44:30.876
...I killed him.

44:33.880 --> 44:36.340
Han Cheoljung, that bastard.

44:38.801 --> 44:40.052
I killed him.

45:00.698 --> 45:01.908
:cue

45:19.675 --> 45:21.093
I'll cut it now.

45:32.188 --> 45:34.565
You have a nice head shape.
Don't worry.

45:35.650 --> 45:38.944
There was that bald singer from the UK.
You used to like her, didn't you?

45:38.945 --> 45:41.655
You kind of look like her.
You look pretty.

45:41.656 --> 45:42.823
Not bad, right?

45:55.419 --> 45:56.963
Heeju isn't my niece.

45:59.090 --> 46:00.632
She's my daughter.

46:00.633 --> 46:01.634
What?

46:06.597 --> 46:08.057
And you're her father.

46:10.017 --> 46:11.269
After you left...

46:12.144 --> 46:14.272
...I found out that I was pregnant.

46:16.732 --> 46:18.985
The house where we lived together
in Namju...

46:20.486 --> 46:21.904
...that's where Heeju was born.

46:26.117 --> 46:27.910
You're kidding, right?

46:28.536 --> 46:29.537
It's a joke.

46:31.163 --> 46:32.415
That doesn't make any sense.

46:33.249 --> 46:35.668
I was going to keep it
a secret until I died.

46:36.836 --> 46:39.046
I didn't think I'd see you again.

46:39.880 --> 46:41.047
Okay, then.

46:41.048 --> 46:42.341
Why say all of this now?

46:43.968 --> 46:44.969
Jinman.

46:51.058 --> 46:52.059
Heeju...

46:53.185 --> 46:56.022
I think she's unhappy nowadays.

46:57.606 --> 46:59.150
She's in trouble.

47:00.693 --> 47:02.153
And it's all because of me, I know.

47:03.529 --> 47:06.198
I just can't be buried with all
of that guilt.

47:06.949 --> 47:09.118
Not when it was me
who made her that way.

47:10.161 --> 47:12.371
I've always told her she
was a luckless brat...

47:13.497 --> 47:15.333
...born from a luckless bitch.

47:17.626 --> 47:18.627
So could you...

47:19.670 --> 47:21.297
...could you please take care of her?

47:23.299 --> 47:25.509
Don't let her ruin
her life any further.

47:25.843 --> 47:28.511
Keep her out of prison
and safe from bad men.

47:29.889 --> 47:31.390
You're a police officer.

47:31.974 --> 47:33.017
And her dad.

47:33.601 --> 47:36.687
- So you need to protect your daughter now.
-  Enough.

47:38.272 --> 47:39.440
Hey.

47:40.858 --> 47:43.444
Listen, I just have to ask,
how am I supposed to believe you?

47:43.903 --> 47:44.904
Huh?

47:45.696 --> 47:49.032
You were a working girl.
A lady of the night.

47:49.033 --> 47:50.367
What?

47:51.702 --> 47:53.287
You mean when I was a hostess?

47:53.996 --> 47:54.997
Yeah.

47:55.289 --> 47:56.290
I mean...

47:57.041 --> 47:59.460
...seriously, how the fuck would
I know whose daughter she is?

48:00.044 --> 48:01.127
I wouldn't.

48:01.128 --> 48:02.213
I do, though.

48:03.881 --> 48:05.508
You were the only one I was with then.

48:10.721 --> 48:13.432
Shit, this is really fucked.

48:22.316 --> 48:23.984
Shit.

48:29.907 --> 48:34.119
Hey. Have you told her, you know, that-

48:34.120 --> 48:35.787
that I'm, uh-I'm her dad?

48:35.788 --> 48:37.581
Or, does she know?

48:38.541 --> 48:39.583
I haven't.

48:41.168 --> 48:43.003
Heeju believes her father's dead.

48:45.798 --> 48:49.844
Would you tell your daughter
that her father was a gambling addict...

48:50.803 --> 48:52.763
...who ran off and abandoned her?

48:53.431 --> 48:54.974
That's good, then, yeah?

48:55.558 --> 48:57.309
Just keep it that way, okay?

48:58.102 --> 49:00.270
'Cause I-
I'm not her father.

49:00.271 --> 49:02.356
Got it?
Don't tell her.

49:03.065 --> 49:06.025
If you tell her I'm her father,
or anything like that,

49:06.026 --> 49:09.488
you, me, and her,
we're all gonna be fucked.

49:11.490 --> 49:13.324
The three of us will die.

49:13.325 --> 49:14.326
Understand?

49:15.494 --> 49:17.496
So stop saying nonsense.

49:18.414 --> 49:19.664
Seriously.

49:34.305 --> 49:35.806
:cue

50:50.256 --> 50:52.925
Mokcheon Port, 9:00 p.m. tomorrow.

50:55.386 --> 50:56.428
See you there.

51:16.115 --> 51:18.450
INCOMING CALL
AUNTIE MIJA

51:20.411 --> 51:21.870
Hey, Auntie.

51:22.371 --> 51:23.746
Hey.

51:23.747 --> 51:25.124
Are you coming today?

51:27.042 --> 51:28.668
Why aren't you saying anything?

51:29.837 --> 51:32.881
You should be here.
Your mom might be dying.

51:33.465 --> 51:35.717
Ah, I just have a bad feeling.

51:35.718 --> 51:37.386
I really think you should come.

51:39.471 --> 51:40.556
Okay.

51:51.650 --> 51:52.776
Sunok.

51:53.277 --> 51:54.945
Everything will be all right.

51:55.654 --> 51:57.990
Just stay calm. Okay?

51:58.782 --> 51:59.866
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

51:59.867 --> 52:02.161
Oh, and Heeju will be here soon.

52:02.828 --> 52:03.871
See you later!

52:13.589 --> 52:19.261
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

52:20.304 --> 52:21.846
Is it over already?

52:21.847 --> 52:22.930
Yeah.

52:24.808 --> 52:26.602
They closed her up right away.

52:28.854 --> 52:31.273
I spoke with the doctor
before I called you.

52:32.066 --> 52:34.693
They said from here on out,
chemo won't help her.

52:36.695 --> 52:38.322
So she should go home.

52:38.781 --> 52:41.074
And spend the rest
of her time with family.

52:43.243 --> 52:44.536
Where are you right now?

52:45.621 --> 52:47.206
Why aren't you over here?

53:18.320 --> 53:19.780
Hi, Mom.

53:30.457 --> 53:33.585
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL
EMERGENCY CENTER
